<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/msa@/~cl_32__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam subseksyen 30d(1) yang dinomborkan semula, dengan menggantikan perkataan “seksyen 30a atau 30b” dengan perkataan “seksyen 30b atau 30c”. Penggantian seksyen 31a"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/msa@/~cl_33> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/msa@/~cl_33> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "33" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/msa@> .
